# Docs

::summary
The Docs library surface in the shell wrapper (per the shell.surf composition ruling): ruled 880px centered column, title row with icon+label New Doc / Folders / Filter actions (08-24 docs-toolbar round: the count stamp is gone and Folders is a first-class button, not a list row), doc rows whose meta leads with the display-cased subtype label (Web / Doc / Presentation, else the capitalized slug — W-2) before the updated stamp, load-more sentinel. The inline filter row is gone (G4 ruling 08-10): the iOS sort + status vocabulary lives in `modals/filter.surf`, opened from the Filter button. The New Doc sheet is `modals/create.surf` (Doc kind) — no inline copy.
::

