::

The list uses the ruled 880px centered column (`width=880 align=center` on the tab-content). Row select pushes `doc-detail`. Title-row actions carry icon AND label (08-24 docs-toolbar round, superseding the G3 icon-only ruling 08-10 for this surface): New Doc, Folders (`openFolders` — the all-folders listing at `?folders=1`), Filter. Verbs unchanged. The doc COUNT is no longer stamped in the title row, and folders are no longer the list's first row — the Folders button is the one route to them. The inline filter row and its accent-ring toggle are REMOVED (G4 ruling 08-10) — sort and status controls live in the anchored filter sheet (`modals/filter.surf`), opened from the Filter button. The Import-PDF title-row button is REMOVED (D7 ruling 08-12); the describe-it create flow stays pure.

## New Doc sheet

Defined ONCE in `modals/create.surf` (`name=create`, Doc kind: describe → Generate seeds the Surfy composer, "Create a blank doc instead" escape). The title-row New Doc button opens it via `openCreateDoc`; this file carries no inline copy.

## Filter sheet

Defined ONCE in `modals/filter.surf` (`name=filter`, anchored to the title-row Filter button): the Sort and status dropdowns moved out of the deleted inline row (G4). The Filter button opens it via `toggleFilter` (spec WP-E names `openFilter` as the eventual verb); this file carries no inline copy.
